                                old_text: Some(
                                    "Design decisions (Eric's calls):\n- **Parallel system** — ignore existing AI chat models (`AssistantMessagePart` etc.); nothing persisted, messages derived from the log on every read (\"type land\")\n- **Plain lib, no hex** — deleted domain/ports stubs; pure fn `fold(impl IntoIterator<Item = LogEntry>) -> Fold`\n- **No Result** — fold is total; renderable-partial beats failing (pending tool call = in-flight state, not error). Weirdness goes to `Fold::anomalies` (tests assert empty; prod degrades gracefully)\n- **One explicit match** in `fold()`, not a handler registry — every understood/ignored frame named in one place\n\nStructure: `src/message.rs` (FoldedMessage/MessagePart/ToolUse/ToolDetail/Permission vocabulary, TurnId per prompt→stop cycle), `src/fold.rs` (State machine: turns, toolCallId patch correlation, JSON-RPC id permission correlation), `src/meta.rs` (quarantined Claude-Code `_meta` readers: toolName, terminal_output — snapshots not deltas — terminal_exit).",
