                            "new_string": String("Design decisions (Eric's calls):\n- **Parallel system** — ignore existing AI chat models (`AssistantMessagePart` etc.); nothing persisted, messages derived from the log on every read (\"type land\")\n- **Hex crate with a pretend DB** — Eric reversed the earlier plain-lib call: messages are queried *as if stored*. Driving port `FoldedMessageRepo` (list_by_session / get by natural key `MessageId{turn, AuthorKind}`), driven port `SessionLogStore` (mirrors AgentSessionLogRepo::list_by_session), `FoldedMessageService` folds on every read; anomalies → tracing::warn, never errors\n- **No Result on the fold** — fold is total; renderable-partial beats failing (pending tool call = in-flight state, not error). Weirdness goes to `Fold::anomalies` (tests assert empty; prod degrades gracefully)\n- **One explicit match** in `fold()`, not a handler registry — every understood/ignored frame named in one place\n- Fold consumes `agent_session::domain::model::{AgentSessionLog, Message}` directly (no duplicate LogEntry type)\n\nStructure: `domain/message.rs` (FoldedMessage/MessagePart/ToolUse/ToolDetail/Permission vocabulary, TurnId per prompt→stop cycle, MessageId natural key), `domain/fold.rs` (State machine: turns, toolCallId patch correlation, JSON-RPC id permission correlation), `domain/meta.rs` (quarantined Claude-Code `_meta` readers: toolName, terminal_output — snapshots not deltas — terminal_exit), `domain/{ports,service}.rs`, `outbound/memory.rs` (InMemoryLogStore; pg adapter deferred to composition root), `domain/test_support.rs` (shared recording parser). Ports follow channels style: RPITIT `+ Send`, `rootcause::Report` errors, `#[tracing::instrument(err, skip(self))]`."),
